; exit 15 (see .exit)
; MM-LIFE-2g, the SURPLUS half: an argument applied to a closure that
; is not the head of its own spine carries no evidence class, so a
; store of it inside the lambda takes no share.
;
; WHY A THIRD FILE. `460-closure-reclaim.ax` reports through an exit
; status and has used all eight of its bits (255);
; `461-curried-closure-arg.ax` is about DEPTH - which of a curried
; lambda's parameters is being stored - and every one of its shapes is
; a lambda applied where it stands. This file is about the OTHER axis:
; the same one-parameter lambda, storing its own argument at depth 0,
; reached through the two application paths that are not
; `walkAppChain`'s own.
;
; THE MECHANISM. `evClassOf` answers `EV_LAMARG` for a lambda
; parameter whose type is a variable, and codegen turns that into a
; retain under bit 0 of the word the APPLICATION passes
; (`emitRetainIfLamArg`). `walkAppChain` records that word for every
; application node and `emitIndirectCall` snapshots the vector. Two
; paths reached `emitApplyChain` without it and passed `vecNew`, which
; `evOperandAt` reads as 0 - "not a reference" - at every step:
;
;   4  the OVER-APPLIED path. `((mkParker log) h.name)` is ONE spine:
;      `walkAppChain` flattens it to the head `mkParker` with two
;      arguments, `mkParker` has arity one, and `emitOverApplied`
;      calls it with the first and applies the surplus through a
;      closure. The class of `h.name` was recorded on the outer
;      application node and then thrown away.
;
;   8  the CAST SPINE. `((cast Int f) h.name)` is also one spine, and
;      `cast` consumes two of its three arguments; the rest are an
;      application of its result. Here the class was never recorded at
;      all: `checkCastForm` claims the whole spine at its outermost
;      node, so the intermediate application nodes never reached the
;      arm that stamps them.
;
;   2  the control - the same lambda applied where it stands, which
;      has always been correct and must stay so, or the two rows above
;      would be measuring a broken program rather than a wrong share.
;
;   1  every step ran.
;
; MEASURED. Against `9116167` (0.6.0), with a compiler built from that
; tree: this file exits 3 - the control alone. Each wrong shape reads
; 122, the `z` of the five-byte string allocated into the block after
; `(set h.name ..)` released the only counted share, where 97 is the
; `a` that was parked. `axiom check` prints OK on every one of them.
;
; The two rows are independent and the fix is in two places: threading
; `spineEvs` through `dispatchCall` moves 4 alone, and stamping
; `cast`'s surplus in `checkCastArgs` moves 8 alone.
(import Str)

(import Vec)

(struct Holder
  (mut name : String))

(:: b2i (-> Bool Int))

(fn (b2i x)
  (if x
    1
    0
  )
)

; A factory whose result is a one-parameter lambda over a type
; VARIABLE. The variable is what makes the parameter's class a
; question only the application can answer - a ground `String` here
; would be classified where the lambda is checked and would not
; exercise the evidence word at all.
(:: mkParker (-> Int (-> a Int)))

(fn (mkParker log) (lambda (v) (vecPush log v)))

(:: parkedByte (-> Int Int))

(fn (parkedByte pick)
  (let ((log vecNew))
    (let ((h (Holder (strDup "alice"))))
      {
        (if (== pick 0)
          ((lambda (v) (vecPush log v)) h.name)
          (if (== pick 1)
            ((mkParker log) h.name)
            ((cast Int (lambda (v) (vecPush log v))) h.name)
          )
        )
        ; Event 5: the field's only counted share goes.
        (set h.name (strDup "bob"))
        ; Allocated after it, so a freed block comes back here and the
        ; read below sees these bytes instead of the parked ones.
        (strDup "zzzzz")
        (strByte (vecGetStr log 0) 0)
      }
    )
  )
)

(:: main Int)

(fn (main)
  (let ((mut acc 0) (mut steps 0))
    {
      (set acc (+ acc (* 2 (b2i (== (parkedByte 0) 97)))))
      (set steps (+ steps 1))
      (set acc (+ acc (* 4 (b2i (== (parkedByte 1) 97)))))
      (set steps (+ steps 1))
      (set acc (+ acc (* 8 (b2i (== (parkedByte 2) 97)))))
      (set steps (+ steps 1))
      (if (== steps 3)
        (+ acc 1)
        acc
      )
    }
  )
)
